00:55:04.245 --> 00:55:07.285
a bit of difference. All three formulas

00:55:07.525 --> 00:55:09.045
that they used

00:55:09.830 --> 00:55:14.790
essentially came up with the same cost basis for the town of Andover.

00:55:15.910 --> 00:55:17.030
