00:55:24.915 --> 00:55:29.395
And the end result is we settled on a formula that is

00:55:30.435 --> 00:55:32.275
50% weighted by

00:55:32.435 --> 00:55:33.715
the population

00:55:33.875 --> 00:55:36.915
of each town as determined by the

00:55:37.795 --> 00:55:39.475
every ten year census.

00:55:39.475 --> 00:55:40.435
And

00:55:40.620 --> 00:55:41.660
factor is

00:55:41.740 --> 00:55:43.740
the school age population.

00:55:43.740 --> 00:55:44.940
So the population

00:55:45.420 --> 00:55:47.100
of all students

00:55:47.100 --> 00:55:48.540
K through 12,

00:55:49.980 --> 00:55:52.620
which seems to be as fair a formula as any.

00:55:53.815 --> 00:56:01.255
